OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to demolish mill for family
OL,4,Ahomes submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn old mill complex could be demolished
OL,7,Fto make way for family homes, under
OL,8,Fplans to be considered by Bradford
OL,9,FCouncil.
OL,11,FWadsworth Mill, in Oxenhope, would be
OL,12,Fknocked down and replaced with 22
OL,13,Fhouses, under the proposals.
OL,15,FThe site, on Jew Lane, is currently
OL,16,Fowned and occupied by a company which
OL,17,Fmakes metal springs.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
