OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to demolish mill for family
OL,4,Ahomes submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planning application submitted to the
OL,7,Fcouncil said the prospect of converting
OL,8,Fthe mill complex into housing had been
OL,9,Fconsidered, but that the structural
OL,10,Fcondition of the buildings was "so
OL,11,Fpoor", demolition was believed to be
OL,12,Fnecessary.
